## 🔄 Vectorization - R's Superpower!

```
VECTORIZED (FAST - in C):
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ result <- (1:1000000) * 2   │
│ → Instant execution         │
│ → Compiled code             │
│ → 100-1000x faster          │
└─────────────────────────────┘

LOOP (SLOW - interpreted):
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ result <- numeric(1000000)           │
│ for (i in 1:1000000) {               │
│   result[i] <- i * 2                 │
│ }                                     │
│ → Interpreted loop                   │
│ → Each iteration interpreted         │
│ → Much slower!                       │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘

KEY INSIGHT: Always use vectorization instead of loops!
```

