## ⚠️ Common Mistakes Matrix

| Mistake | Right Way | Why |
|---------|-----------|-----|
| `x[0]` for first element | `x[1]` | R is 1-indexed |
| `if (x>5 & x<10)` with vector | `if (any(x>5 & x<10))` | if() needs single value |
| `c(1, "2") + 1` | `as.numeric(c(1,"2")) + 1` | Type mismatch error |
| Loop for simple operation | Vectorize: `x * 2` | Loops 100x slower |
| `df[df$age > 25]` | `df[df$age > 25, ]` | Data frame needs comma |
| Forgetting to increment `i` | `i <- i + 1` inside loop | Infinite loop otherwise |
| Growing vector in loop | Pre-allocate: `x <- numeric(n)` | Much faster |

