## 🎯 When to Use Which

| Structure | When to Use | Example |
|-----------|------------|---------|
| **Vector** | Single variable, homogeneous | `ages <- c(25, 30, 35)` |
| **Matrix** | Math operations, all same type | `m <- matrix(1:12, nrow=3)` |
| **Data Frame** | Real data, mixed types | `df <- read.csv("data.csv")` |
| **List** | Return multiple values | `list(x=1, y=2, z=3)` |
| **Factor** | Categorical only | `gender <- factor(c("M","F"))` |

