## 💡 Quick Decision Guides

### "How do I...?"

**Create a vector?**
```r
c(1, 2, 3)  OR  1:10  OR  seq(1, 10, by=2)  OR  rep(1:3, times=2)
```

**Access elements?**
```r
x[1]        # Position 1
x[c(1,3)]   # Positions 1 and 3
x[-2]       # All except 2
x[x > 5]    # Where x > 5
x["name"]   # By name
```

**Filter data frame?**
```r
df[df$age > 25, ]  # Rows where age > 25
```

**Add column?**
```r
df$new_col <- values  OR  df <- cbind(df, new_col=values)
```

**Apply function to data?**
```r
sapply(list, function)  OR  apply(matrix, 2, function)  OR  lapply(list, function)
```

